		{"id":"note1","type":"text","text":"**The order path is a straight line.**\n\nProposal → sizing → risk gate → approval mode → order manager → broker.\n\nA human clicking *buy* enters at the same place as an agent.","x":340,"y":650,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"1"},
